"end of this array. For better performance, consider using [method "
"append_array] instead."
msgstr ""
"返回新的 [PackedInt32Array]，新数组的内容为此数组在末尾加上 [param right]。为"
"了提高性能，请考虑改用 [method append_array]。"

msgid ""
